1
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:08,125
You want to end our engagement?

2
00:00:08,166 --> 00:00:09,375
That's right.

3
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:10,583
Why?

4
00:00:11,083 --> 00:00:12,708
Because you're a loser.

5
00:00:12,708 --> 00:00:15,000
I'm not wasting
another second on you.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,250
A loser?

7
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:17,750
I took House Scott from nothing

8
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:20,500
to prominence in three years.

9
00:00:20,708 --> 00:00:21,583
And you?

10
00:00:22,125 --> 00:00:23,750
The heir of House Carter,

11
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,666
playing miner with peasants.

12
00:00:25,958 --> 00:00:28,333
If that's not pathetic,
I don't know what is.

13
00:00:29,666 --> 00:00:31,000
That's all it takes?

14
00:00:32,125 --> 00:00:33,708
But that's not even why.

15
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,125
Your father has
completely written you off.

16
00:00:38,166 --> 00:00:40,541
Everyone in Emeraldstone
knows he's giving your

17
00:00:40,541 --> 00:00:43,000
title to your half-brother instead.

18
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,666
So you're throwing away our engagement

19
00:00:44,666 --> 00:00:45,500
just like that?

20
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,666
Exactly!

21
00:00:47,375 --> 00:00:49,375
I won't drag my family down with you.

22
00:00:50,625 --> 00:00:51,541
You had everything, 

23
00:00:51,541 --> 00:00:53,375
and you couldn't even hold onto it.

24
00:00:53,375 --> 00:00:55,000
That's on you.

25
00:01:00,916 --> 00:01:02,916
We grew up together.

26
00:01:02,916 --> 00:01:05,333
You know better than
anyone what my father did,

27
00:01:05,333 --> 00:01:07,791
how he threw away
my mother for some woman.

28
00:01:07,791 --> 00:01:10,458
You know I never gave
a damn about his title!

29
00:01:10,458 --> 00:01:13,416
Enough! I’m not here to argue, Severin.

30
00:01:13,875 --> 00:01:15,125
If you ever loved me,

31
00:01:15,125 --> 00:01:17,291
just sign the damn
papers and let me go.

32
00:01:17,291 --> 00:01:19,958
I won't make
things ugly for you.

33
00:01:19,958 --> 00:01:21,125
No.

34
00:01:22,041 --> 00:01:23,250
Fine.

35
00:01:23,791 --> 00:01:25,750
Then let me tell you something.

36
00:01:25,875 --> 00:01:28,000
The Sovereign Sanctum has claimed me.

37
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,583
They're going to make me supreme

38
00:01:29,583 --> 00:01:31,375
over all Four Great Families.

39
00:01:31,750 --> 00:01:33,416
I will become a goddess.

40
00:01:33,416 --> 00:01:35,000
And when that happens,

41
00:01:35,666 --> 00:01:38,000
how could a filthy miner ever be

42
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,333
worthy of a goddess like me?

43
00:01:43,583 --> 00:01:45,208
The Sovereign Sanctum?

44
00:01:45,541 --> 00:01:47,541
You never once wondered?

45
00:01:47,541 --> 00:01:49,833
Why would an ancient power like that

46
00:01:49,833 --> 00:01:51,041
even bother with...

47
00:01:51,041 --> 00:01:53,000
your forgotten little house?
